**`connector/spanmetricsconnector/config_test.go`**, **`connector/exceptionsconnector/config_test.go`**, **`connector/routingconnector/config_test.go`**, **`connector/signaltometricsconnector/config/config.go`**, **`connector/failoverconnector/config_test.go`** — all test `Validate()` directly.

